Z||000000||BUCK WILLIAMS||12-06-2001||12:15 AM||||HOW MUCH TROUBLE AND EXPENSE IS IT TO SWITCH FROM CRANK WINDOWS TO POWER WINDOWS ON AN 86 SE? AND I GUESS POWER MIRRORS WHILE I AM AT IT!||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jncomutt||12-06-2001||01:09 AM||||Ok.. well I don't know tooo much about it for I've not done this yet.  But I asked about it b4, and its been on a few other threads.  It seems you best bet would be to find a set of doors with the windows/mirrors already in them.  Of course your goin to needed the switches and such for the center column area as well.  As far as actual workmanship, not too sure.  <P>Either way.. .BUMP for ya<BR>||||reg||1
